  "descriptionSection": {
    "title": "Nerida",
    "introduction": {
      "type": "document",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Inspired by castles worn by centuries of use, Nerida natural limestone flooring carries a soft white palette full of quiet movement and character. An antique finish and irregular edges give each tile an aged, hand-worked quality. Rich in texture without feeling heavy, Nerida is perfectly suited to indoor and outdoor projects wanting to inject a lived-in aesthetic and a sense of timelessness. Available in random length tiles with complementary step treads.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "details": {
      "type": "document",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "If you're looking to upgrade your indoor or outdoor space, Eco Outdoor offers natural stone flooring in unique colours, textures, finishes, and formats to spark endless design inspiration. Our curated collection of pavers and tiles includes travertine, limestone, crazy paving, cobblestones, sandstone, split stone, bluestone, terrazzo, terracotta, and granite. We also offer Technifirma porcelain tiles and French oak timber flooring. Visit one of our design showrooms today.",
              "marks": [
                "italic"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "readMore": true,
    "accent": "white",
